      145.2,
      376.2,
      443.78,
      386.28
    ],
    "text": "FILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      63.12,
      388.2,
      526.04,
      410.28
    ],
    "text": "VALIKAMAM EAST PRADESHIYA SABHAUNDER SECTION 66 A (1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.96,
      424.16,
      501.01,
      434.24
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of member of Valikamam East Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen Vacant by reason of resignation:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.96,
      444.56,
      540.11,
      490.64
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the All Ceylon Tamil Congress the recognized political party to which ShanthirasekaramPiratheepan the member belonged, was required by me under section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide uponreturned member of All Ceylon Tamil Congress who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under section 9 of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of Thirty (30) days;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.96,
      502.16,
      540.12,
      524.23
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision to nominateIlayavan Mayilvakanam to fill such vacancy;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.96,
      535.76,
      540.2,
      569.84
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE Thanabalasingam Akilan, returning Officer of the Valikamam East Pradeshiya Sabha acting in termsof selection 66 A (1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that Ilayavan Mayilvakanamwas selected as the member of the Valikamam East Pradeshiya Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      360.96,
      583.76,
      528.88,
      617.84
    ],
    "text": "T. AKILAN, Returning Officer, Valikamam East Pradeshiya Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
